{%- comment -%}
  icon — every icon in the theme. Replaces 3.3MB of Line Awesome webfont.

  Usage:  {% render 'icon', name: 'search' %}
          {% render 'icon', name: 'chevron-down', class: 'icon--sm' %}
          {% render 'icon', name: 'bag', size: 20 %}

  Style comes from .fye .icon in fye-core.css: fill none, stroke currentColor,
  stroke-width 1.3, square caps. Thin outline line-art only — brand rule.
  Do NOT add filled icons or a second stroke weight here.

  Geometry is Lucide (MIT), which matches the brand's line-art spec. Flagged in
  the design system as a substitution: swap for FYE's own set if one is drawn.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign cls = class | default: ''
  assign sz = size | default: 24
-%}
<svg class="icon {{ cls }}" width="{{ sz }}" height="{{ sz }}" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" role="presentation">
  {%- case name -%}

    {%- comment -%} ---- Utility / header ---- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'search' -%}
      <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"></circle><path d="M20 20l-4.35-4.35"></path>
    {%- when 'account' -%}
      <path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
    {%- when 'heart' -%}
      <path d="M20.8 5.6a5 5 0 0 0-7.1 0L12 7.3l-1.7-1.7a5 5 0 1 0-7.1 7.1L12 21.5l8.8-8.8a5 5 0 0 0 0-7.1z"></path>
    {%- when 'bag' -%}
      <path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6l-3-4z"></path><path d="M3 6h18"></path><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0"></path>
    {%- when 'menu' -%}
      <path d="M3 6h18M3 12h18M3 18h18"></path>
    {%- when 'close' -%}
      <path d="M18 6 6 18M6 6l12 12"></path>

    {%- comment -%} ---- Direction ---- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'chevron-down' -%}
      <path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path>
    {%- when 'chevron-up' -%}
      <path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path>
    {%- when 'chevron-left' -%}
      <path d="m15 18-6-6 6-6"></path>
    {%- when 'chevron-right' -%}
      <path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path>
    {%- when 'arrow-right' -%}
      <path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
    {%- when 'arrow-left' -%}
      <path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
    {%- comment -%}
      Vertical arrows, added 01/09/2026 for the carat stepper. A scale runs up
      and down, not left and right — "larger" is up whichever side of the row
      the control sits on.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'arrow-up' -%}
      <path d="M12 19V5M5 12l7-7 7 7"></path>
    {%- when 'arrow-down' -%}
      <path d="M12 5v14M19 12l-7 7-7-7"></path>

    {%- comment -%} ---- Affordances ---- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'plus' -%}
      <path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path>
    {%- when 'minus' -%}
      <path d="M5 12h14"></path>
    {%- when 'check' -%}
      <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path>
    {%- when 'download' -%}
      <path d="M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4"></path><path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"></path><path d="M12 15V3"></path>
    {%- when 'play' -%}
      <path d="M6 3l14 9-14 9V3z"></path>
    {%- when 'filter' -%}
      <path d="M3 6h18M7 12h10M10 18h4"></path>

    {%- comment -%} ---- Contact ---- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'phone' -%}
      <path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1 1 .4 1.9.7 2.8a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.5 2.8.6a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"></path>
    {%- when 'mail' -%}
      <rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16"></rect><path d="m2 6 10 7 10-7"></path>
    {%- when 'pin' -%}
      <path d="M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
    {%- when 'calendar' -%}
      <rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16"></rect><path d="M8 2v4M16 2v4M3 10h18"></path>
    {%- comment -%}
      A conversation icon, used for the WhatsApp contact row. Deliberately NOT
      the WhatsApp logo: brand rule is thin outline line-art only, and a
      third-party brand mark in the middle of a teal band is neither that nor
      ours to restyle. The row's label says WhatsApp.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'message' -%}
      <path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-9 8.4 9.9 9.9 0 0 1-2.8-.4L3 21l1.6-4.6A8.1 8.1 0 0 1 3 11.5 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 12 3a8.4 8.4 0 0 1 9 8.5z"></path>

    {%- comment -%} ---- Guarantees ---- {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'shipping' -%}
      <path d="M1 4h14v11H1z"></path><path d="M15 8h4l3 3v4h-7"></path><circle cx="5.5" cy="18" r="2"></circle><circle cx="17.5" cy="18" r="2"></circle>
    {%- when 'warranty' -%}
      <path d="M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.4 8 11 4.6-1.6 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path>
    {%- when 'resize' -%}
      <path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="m8 8-4 4 4 4M16 8l4 4-4 4"></path>
    {%- when 'ethical' -%}
      <path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 4 13c0-6 7-9 7-9s7 3 7 9a7 7 0 0 1-7 7z"></path><path d="M11 20v-9"></path>
    {%- when 'star' -%}
      <path d="m12 2 3.1 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.8 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"></path>
    {%- when 'certificate' -%}
      <circle cx="12" cy="9" r="6"></circle><path d="m9 14-2 8 5-3 5 3-2-8"></path>
    {%- comment -%}
      Scales, for "fair and transparent". A balance reads as fairness without
      needing a label; the alternative (a price tag) reads as a discount.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'scales' -%}
      <path d="M12 3v18M7 21h10"></path><path d="M12 6 5 8l-2 5h8L7 8M12 6l7 2 2 5h-8l4-5"></path>
    {%- comment -%} Two figures: personal guidance, a conversation with a human. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- when 'guidance' -%}
      <path d="M15 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="8.5" cy="7" r="3.5"></circle><path d="M17 3.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.8"></path>

    {%- else -%}
      {%- comment -%} Unknown name: render nothing, but leave a trace in the
        markup so it is findable rather than mysteriously invisible. {%- endcomment -%}
      <!-- icon not found: {{ name }} -->
  {%- endcase -%}
</svg>
